  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.3.0: Streaming & document masking (ported from Synthelion 1.2.5 privacy_stream.py / document_extractor.py). PrivacyStreamMasker: boundary-safe chunked/streaming PII masking with a configurable overlap window (default 512 chars) so patterns spanning a chunk boundary are caught; Feed()/Flush() API for incremental streams and a MaskStream() convenience helper for chunked iterables. PrivacySession.Summary(): redacted placeholder+category view (never the original value) safe to log/display/return over APIs, unlike GetAll()/ToJson() which carry cleartext PII (their XML docs now warn about this). DocumentMasker: streaming masking of plain text, Markdown and CSV files into a \"name.masked.ext\" copy next to the source (the original is never overwritten) — files are processed in chunks, never loaded whole; CSV rows are read with a minimal RFC-4180-aware reader so quoted multi-line cells survive. Added 12 new regression tests. 1.2.2: NuGet icon restored (caveman-icon.png now packed and referenced via PackageIcon).",
